---
description: Do not bake every dialect driver into committed package manifests.
alwaysApply: true
---

# migrate-init owns driver dependencies

Do not add all datasource driver dependencies to committed package manifests or project references (`package.json`, `Cargo.toml` default features, `PackageReference`s, `dialects.props`). That makes published and vendored bundles too large.

`migrate-init --language … --dialect …` is what installs or enables only the selected drivers (npm packages, Cargo default features, C# `PackageReference`s). Committed defaults stay slim. A full local set is `--all`, not a committed kitchen-sink dependency list.
